 "fit_note": "Voices fitted against IKAOPLL renders of a low-extended 8-note probe set.  The current set (2026-11-22) fixes the waveform select at 0 on both operators -- the OPL3 melodic conversion is plain two-operator, an extension of the Y8950 set -- and was searched under a per-partial harmonic score (levels relative to each tone's own fundamental, excess partials weighted), starting from the earlier fitted set, the Y8950 fitted set and the unfitted frame.  Earlier passes (2026-11-16 against the OPM table, 2026-11-20 against real YM2413 recordings, 2026-11-21/22 with waveform select in play) were intermediate stages; see OPL3_FIT in make_presets.py.",
